{"4258650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Appetite for Destruction", "steam_appid": 4258650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A game about chaos between friends, in a world where walls crumble as easily as trust.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/14dab7dc7a90d09924c9f6a10581c18d.avif?t=1774912198\" width=800 height=180 /></span>Walls aren’t obstacles — they’re suggestions.  <br>Blast new paths, collapse floors, and reshape the map… just try not to bury your objective in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/a5f637250e432ace695a4459df8d0924.poster.avif?t=1774912198\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/a5f637250e432ace695a4459df8d0924.webm?t=1774912198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/a5f637250e432ace695a4459df8d0924.mp4?t=1774912198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/96703363c4bafc45baab9c36acd82f8f.avif?t=1774912198\" width=800 height=180 /></span>Break in. Grab valuables. Get out. <br>Sounds simple — until the building, your plan, and your teammates start falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/05649ee8f1e7d2d8f99a8ac0dc3d71b7.poster.avif?t=1774912198\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/05649ee8f1e7d2d8f99a8ac0dc3d71b7.webm?t=1774912198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/05649ee8f1e7d2d8f99a8ac0dc3d71b7.mp4?t=1774912198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/58174e668d20b0b914480d9e78da4628.avif?t=1774912198\" width=800 height=180 /></span>Every mission is about <strong>getting valuables out in one piece</strong>. <br>Objects have weight, balance, and very bad reactions to explosions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop it. Smash it. Burn it.<br>No payout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/5648b47afd7c07eaa7356a44cda613af.poster.avif?t=1774912198\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/5648b47afd7c07eaa7356a44cda613af.webm?t=1774912198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/5648b47afd7c07eaa7356a44cda613af.mp4?t=1774912198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/80d4efaf1417d8fa854bd405786e2647.avif?t=1774912198\" width=800 height=180 /></span>Work together to carry heavy loot, hold doors, and survive the chaos. <br>Or panic, push the wrong button, and “accidentally” ruin everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your biggest threat might be your own team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/b283ee1f4b1dbce047c1cd01df3a25f1.poster.avif?t=1774912198\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/b283ee1f4b1dbce047c1cd01df3a25f1.webm?t=1774912198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/b283ee1f4b1dbce047c1cd01df3a25f1.mp4?t=1774912198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/86eb314703b6000b5be6ad6e65629892.avif?t=1774912198\" width=800 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not alone on the job.<br>Creatures, hazards, and collapsing environments turn every mission into a race against total disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/9fad720a6e583beed2e44c882d8db1bd.poster.avif?t=1774912198\" width=800 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/9fad720a6e583beed2e44c882d8db1bd.webm?t=1774912198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4258650/extras/9fad720a6e583beed2e44c882d8db1bd.mp4?t=1774912198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A game about chaos between friends, in a world where walls crumble as easily as trust.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_